Bundled NHTSA-derived records
-----------------------------
The following references are transcribed from report_number, source_reference
and test_number in app/data/nhtsa_ab_library.json. They identify the recorded
sources; the original reports have not been independently verified here.

- Chevrolet Malibu 2008: report M80102; test 6268.
- Subaru Outback 2020: report O20205502; test 10962.
- Toyota Corolla 2019: report O20195100; test not recorded.
- Jeep Compass 2024: report M20240300; test not recorded.

Database referenced by the project:
https://www.nhtsa.gov/research-data/vehicle-crash-test-database

A/B coefficients are derived by the application from the recorded inputs,
not represented as coefficients published or endorsed by NHTSA.
CRASH3Vision is not affiliated with or endorsed by NHTSA.
These identifiers do not establish redistribution permissions for associated
reports, photographs or videos. The coefficient library does not contain
those files. The separate Jeep Compass example in the source distribution
includes attributed NHTSA frames. The v1.1.0 Windows ZIP and installer include
the example and its source attribution README.

